WEBVTT

00:13.160 --> 00:15.728
The Sixth Prince was punished
to kneel outside the East Palace?

00:16.032 --> 00:19.230
His Highness somehow angered Crown
Prince badly that he coughed up blood.

00:19.480 --> 00:21.070
When the news got out,

00:21.070 --> 00:22.710
the Crown Prince was still unconscious.

00:23.550 --> 00:25.350
His Majesty was furious.

00:26.230 --> 00:26.920
Your Highness.

00:28.640 --> 00:29.920
A child delivered this.

00:30.070 --> 00:31.350
There is no signature,

00:31.350 --> 00:32.480
so we don't know who sent it.

00:34.020 --> 00:37.500
(The hour of Wei, Dengying Theater)

00:38.710 --> 00:41.960
There was a young master in the capital
who loved a lady in his youth.

00:42.240 --> 00:45.520
After her husband died,
he wanted to be with her again.

00:45.790 --> 00:49.470
But ashamed to make her a concubine,
he decided to get rid of his wife.

00:50.790 --> 00:53.030
So he plotted carefully

00:53.240 --> 00:56.240
feeding his wife the wrong medicine,
little by little,

00:56.430 --> 00:58.030
until it killed her.

00:58.430 --> 01:01.430
Soon after, he took the lady
as his new wife.

01:11.430 --> 01:13.870
(Why does the Sixth Prince
smell exactly like)

01:13.870 --> 01:15.000
(that dancer?)

01:18.040 --> 01:19.590
(What a clever sleight of hand.)

01:19.632 --> 01:21.936
(The Sixth Prince killed his wife
to marry his mistress.)

01:22.070 --> 01:23.760
(So he's scheming against me.)

02:44.660 --> 02:45.504
=Blossoms of Power=

02:45.504 --> 02:48.260
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

02:48.340 --> 02:51.300
=Episode 4=

03:14.880 --> 03:16.528
What brings you here, Your Highness?

03:17.240 --> 03:19.400
I just watched a very interesting
shadow puppet play.

03:20.400 --> 03:21.560
And it got me thinking

03:21.560 --> 03:22.910
about your plan.

03:23.680 --> 03:24.960
What plan?

03:25.590 --> 03:26.430
Marry me,

03:26.680 --> 03:27.560
and then kill me.

03:28.360 --> 03:29.840
By then, the northwestern army

03:30.030 --> 03:31.190
will be in your hands.

03:31.560 --> 03:32.840
Then you can ask His Majesty

03:33.360 --> 03:35.800
to let you marry Bian Xianyi
as your second wife.

03:36.080 --> 03:37.120
A foolproof plan.

03:42.870 --> 03:44.710
I am truly devoted to you.

03:45.470 --> 03:48.240
I don't know where
you heard such rumors.

03:49.400 --> 03:50.710
But without any proof,

03:50.880 --> 03:52.224
you must not believe them.

03:53.680 --> 03:54.630
You want proof?

03:56.120 --> 03:57.360
Your Highness,

03:57.800 --> 03:59.590
that jade dew perfume you're wearing

03:59.750 --> 04:00.870
is uniquely fresh and cool,

04:01.000 --> 04:02.360
and impossible to forget.

04:02.840 --> 04:05.240
It is exactly the same
scent Bian Xianyi wears.

04:07.590 --> 04:09.400
I have never liked speaking in riddles.

04:09.870 --> 04:12.280
So why don't we lay
everything out in the open

04:12.800 --> 04:15.470
and put an end to someone's delusions?

04:15.910 --> 04:16.560
From now on,

04:17.070 --> 04:18.040
stay away from me.

04:30.750 --> 04:32.950
I almost let Prince Yu's
good looks fool me.

04:32.950 --> 04:34.090
If you had married him,

04:34.100 --> 04:35.820
the consequences would
have been unthinkable.

04:35.830 --> 04:37.160
They grew up in the palace.

04:37.510 --> 04:38.750
All that deception,

04:39.480 --> 04:40.430
and all those schemes,

04:40.830 --> 04:42.510
they were born knowing how to use them.

04:43.190 --> 04:44.600
Prince Lie has a terrible temper.

04:44.720 --> 04:46.040
Prince Xin is cold as ice.

04:46.040 --> 04:48.430
Prince Yu looks like an angel,
but has a wicked heart.

04:48.430 --> 04:49.600
Now only Prince Ning is left.

04:49.900 --> 04:51.120
He has an excellent reputation.

04:51.120 --> 04:52.270
Let us hope he deserves it.

04:52.600 --> 04:54.270
You forgot the Crown Prince.

04:54.360 --> 04:56.120
He's always so gentle and gracious

04:56.120 --> 04:59.000
with Her Highness.

04:59.240 --> 05:00.160
He is sickly.

05:00.272 --> 05:01.408
What is so good about him?

05:01.630 --> 05:02.870
He is gentle.

05:02.870 --> 05:03.680
And since he is weak,

05:03.680 --> 05:04.680
in the East Palace,

05:04.680 --> 05:06.580
the Crown Princess would be
the one in charge.

05:06.600 --> 05:07.600
When he takes the throne,

05:07.600 --> 05:10.040
she'll become the empress
who rules beside him.

05:11.600 --> 05:12.920
That sickly Crown Prince

05:13.240 --> 05:14.600
handles everything very properly.

05:15.270 --> 05:17.600
And he seems naturally good-tempered.

05:18.190 --> 05:19.480
Is that not good?

05:20.496 --> 05:22.096
I don't like things that seem too easy.

05:22.510 --> 05:23.630
They are too deceiving.

05:24.144 --> 05:25.870
I need to watch him a little longer.

05:28.720 --> 05:29.430
Right now,

05:29.630 --> 05:30.870
the Tagara Incense

05:31.000 --> 05:32.390
is what worries me the most.

05:33.870 --> 05:35.070
The richest man's son,

05:35.390 --> 05:36.360
the Embroidered Envoys,

05:36.630 --> 05:37.830
and the Deputy Chief Justice.

05:37.952 --> 05:39.630
He can impersonate them all with ease,

05:40.000 --> 05:42.040
and no one ever holds him accountable.

05:42.560 --> 05:43.390
Not to mention,

05:43.480 --> 05:46.360
Cui Jinbai has always been
groomed to become chancellor.

05:46.680 --> 05:48.190
In this whole world,

05:48.430 --> 05:49.800
the richest,

05:49.800 --> 05:50.870
the strongest,

05:50.950 --> 05:52.160
and the most promising men

05:52.160 --> 05:54.480
all answer to the Tagara Incense.

05:54.800 --> 05:57.120
This person is the real mystery.

06:00.870 --> 06:02.040
Who could it be?

06:10.420 --> 06:12.620
(The Rouge Ledger)

06:12.630 --> 06:13.740
(Son of Steward Zhao, 100 bolts of silk)
Your Highness.

06:13.750 --> 06:15.872
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
is as decisive as expected.

06:16.040 --> 06:17.800
She confronted Prince Yu directly.

06:18.390 --> 06:20.040
Although Prince Yu denied everything,

06:20.190 --> 06:21.430
his face turned pale.

06:21.950 --> 06:23.000
Oh, Changyu...

06:23.630 --> 06:25.240
His intentions were impure,

06:25.250 --> 06:26.592
and he had no regard for morality.

06:27.700 --> 06:29.740
As Commandery Princess Zhaoning's
potential husband,

06:29.750 --> 06:31.360
he should be out of the running now.

06:32.620 --> 06:37.380
(Prince Yu, Xiao Changyu)

06:37.480 --> 06:38.040
Your Highness,

06:38.230 --> 06:39.560
about the crimes of the officials

06:39.560 --> 06:40.750
recorded in the Rouge Ledger,

06:40.870 --> 06:42.600
do they match any of the clues

06:42.760 --> 06:43.870
you've found over the years?

06:44.950 --> 06:45.390
Come here.

06:45.630 --> 06:46.240
Look here.

06:49.040 --> 06:50.720
This records that
Steward Zhao's only son

06:50.816 --> 06:53.120
was once involved in buying
and selling official posts.

06:53.630 --> 06:54.950
You mean

06:55.510 --> 06:57.120
the person behind the Rouge Ledger

06:57.480 --> 06:58.870
may have used this

06:59.240 --> 07:01.000
to force Steward Zhao to poison someone?

07:01.800 --> 07:02.190
Yes.

07:05.510 --> 07:06.920
This broken lead

07:07.360 --> 07:08.870
finally has a direction again.

07:09.680 --> 07:10.240
Tian Yuan.

07:11.480 --> 07:13.720
Have the Embroidered Envoys
and Cui Jinbai assist you.

07:14.000 --> 07:15.800
Find out who's really behind

07:15.800 --> 07:16.600
the Rouge Ledger.

07:17.104 --> 07:18.096
Yes, Your Highness.

07:28.750 --> 07:29.360
Your Highness,

07:29.456 --> 07:31.800
we've traced the Jati Blossom Incense
from the Rouge Ledger.

07:31.850 --> 07:33.920
In the entire capital,
the only temple that uses it

07:33.920 --> 07:34.870
is Fahua Temple.

07:35.310 --> 07:37.000
Our people found this there.

07:37.630 --> 07:38.270
After checking,

07:38.288 --> 07:41.168
we found this sachet belongs only to
Consort Luo of Prince Kang's manor.

07:42.830 --> 07:43.510
Yes.

07:44.096 --> 07:45.800
This is indeed the Jati Blossom flower.

07:47.070 --> 07:48.000
And this scent

07:48.510 --> 07:50.120
is authentic Jati Blossom Incense.

07:51.430 --> 07:52.480
Find out who she is.

07:52.680 --> 07:53.390
I want to see her.

07:53.776 --> 07:54.800
Yes, Your Highness.

07:56.260 --> 07:58.620
(Shijia Pagoda)

08:01.750 --> 08:02.600
Who are you?

08:03.360 --> 08:04.480
What do you want from me?

08:05.160 --> 08:07.800
Should I call you
Prince Kang's Consort Luo

08:08.430 --> 08:09.430
or should I call you

08:09.630 --> 08:10.390
Yu Xiaodie?

08:10.420 --> 08:12.340
(Prince Kang's Consort Luo)

08:12.480 --> 08:13.560
Ten years ago,

08:14.120 --> 08:15.310
you were nothing more than

08:15.310 --> 08:17.216
a nameless concubine
by Prince Kang's side.

08:17.750 --> 08:18.830
Ten years later,

08:19.390 --> 08:21.040
you've climbed your way up to consort.

08:22.040 --> 08:23.040
That's because

08:23.104 --> 08:24.032
the concubine Yan Zhi,

08:24.048 --> 08:26.630
who incited Vice Minister of Personnel
to sell official posts,

08:27.120 --> 08:28.560
was trained by you.

08:29.600 --> 08:31.800
There are many ladies like her.

08:32.240 --> 08:33.550
You married them one by one

08:33.550 --> 08:35.440
to different high-ranking officials.

08:35.440 --> 08:36.600
Nonsense!

08:37.510 --> 08:39.670
How dare you drag
Prince Kang's Manor into this?

08:41.910 --> 08:43.390
In the entire capital,

08:44.000 --> 08:45.670
only the Buddha statues at Fahua Temple

08:46.030 --> 08:47.870
are coated with Jati Blossom Incense.

08:48.550 --> 08:49.870
The scent is very distinctive

08:50.200 --> 08:51.510
and extremely rare.

08:52.720 --> 08:53.550
And yet,

08:54.000 --> 08:55.030
it's on you,

08:56.150 --> 08:57.390
and on the Rouge Ledger, too.

08:58.120 --> 08:59.190
What a coincidence, right?

08:59.840 --> 09:00.910
What does that prove?

09:03.120 --> 09:03.910
The court will soon

09:03.910 --> 09:06.000
round up all the corrupt officials

09:06.200 --> 09:07.270
listed in the Rouge Ledger.

09:08.150 --> 09:09.390
If they follow the trail,

09:09.510 --> 09:11.510
it won't be hard
to find out you wrote it.

09:11.960 --> 09:12.870
By then,

09:13.480 --> 09:15.550
will Prince Kang throw you out

09:15.550 --> 09:16.910
to take the blame for everything?

09:20.000 --> 09:21.960
If you can give me proof
of Prince Kang's crimes,

09:22.320 --> 09:23.750
you may still have a chance to live.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.150
Weigh the risks

09:26.480 --> 09:27.480
for yourself.

09:29.670 --> 09:30.840
Even if I believe you,

09:32.510 --> 09:33.630
how do you plan to save me?

09:35.000 --> 09:36.480
I'll give you an incense

09:36.600 --> 09:38.080
that will make your body go cold

09:38.200 --> 09:39.390
and your pulse grow weak,

09:39.510 --> 09:40.550
as if you're dead.

09:41.440 --> 09:43.600
After you hand over evidence
of Prince Kang's crimes,

09:43.680 --> 09:45.600
you only need to fake your suicide
out of guilt.

09:45.630 --> 09:47.150
By the time the Rouge case breaks,

09:47.630 --> 09:48.720
you'll already be

09:48.720 --> 09:50.360
a dead lady who's long gone.

09:50.600 --> 09:51.510
What is there to fear?

09:59.150 --> 09:59.750
Your Highness,

09:59.750 --> 10:01.520
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
went privately

10:01.536 --> 10:03.136
to see Prince Kang's Consort Luo.

10:03.440 --> 10:04.320
The beautiful ladies

10:04.320 --> 10:05.910
recorded in the Rouge Ledger

10:06.150 --> 10:08.000
were mostly trained by her
for Prince Kang.

10:08.750 --> 10:09.750
In that case,

10:09.808 --> 10:10.840
Her Highness already knows

10:10.840 --> 10:12.320
the mastermind behind the Rouge Ledger

10:12.440 --> 10:13.360
is Prince Kang.

10:13.392 --> 10:14.752
Congratulations, Your Highness.

10:14.760 --> 10:16.320
If Prince Kang falls and is imprisoned,

10:16.670 --> 10:17.670
we'll surely be able

10:17.670 --> 10:19.392
to make him talk about the poisoning.

10:20.256 --> 10:22.440
I've benefited from
the Commandery Princess's efforts.

10:23.120 --> 10:24.360
She has done me a great favor.

10:25.600 --> 10:27.440
The Commandery Princess is truly

10:27.910 --> 10:29.320
the most unfathomable

10:30.030 --> 10:31.750
and decisive lady I've ever met.

10:34.600 --> 10:35.390
Your Majesty,

10:35.750 --> 10:38.240
we've uncovered the truth
behind the Rouge Ledger case.

10:38.360 --> 10:39.630
The evidence is conclusive.

10:44.360 --> 10:46.270
How horrifying!

10:51.080 --> 10:52.910
Your Majesty,

10:55.000 --> 10:57.870
Prince Kang secretly
ran the Beauty Pavilion.

10:58.000 --> 11:00.600
For over ten years,
the beauties he gifted

11:00.600 --> 11:02.750
were sent to powerful nobles
in the capital,

11:02.750 --> 11:05.960
regional governors,
and key local officials.

11:06.080 --> 11:07.030
In other words,

11:07.720 --> 11:10.720
his spies are planted
throughout the court and beyond.

11:11.550 --> 11:13.320
Many local officials

11:13.320 --> 11:14.510
became connected by marriage,

11:14.510 --> 11:17.270
covering for each other's corruption

11:17.270 --> 11:18.840
and trading favors.

11:18.840 --> 11:20.720
The crimes are too many to count.

11:23.600 --> 11:24.270
Your Majesty,

11:24.630 --> 11:25.790
we've also found

11:25.790 --> 11:27.360
that Prince Kang amassed a fortune

11:27.480 --> 11:29.960
and hid it deep in the mountains
outside the capital.

11:31.960 --> 11:33.120
Issue my decree.

11:33.360 --> 11:34.910
Arrest Prince Kang at once!

11:36.240 --> 11:39.270
Every guilty official listed
in the Rouge Ledger,

11:39.510 --> 11:41.030
not one is to escape.

11:41.910 --> 11:44.030
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

11:58.750 --> 12:00.820
(Prince Kang)
I thought

12:00.840 --> 12:02.750
I had everything under my control.

12:03.840 --> 12:05.390
Never did I imagine

12:05.840 --> 12:08.720
that you had been biding your
time all along, Your Highness,

12:09.720 --> 12:10.870
keeping yourself

12:11.600 --> 12:13.240
so well hidden.

12:14.600 --> 12:17.270
I can spare your mother and your wife.

12:34.480 --> 12:36.750
My crimes warrant the extermination
of my entire clan.

12:37.480 --> 12:39.720
How could you possibly save them?

12:39.720 --> 12:40.270
First,

12:41.870 --> 12:43.670
to rid the court of corrupt officials

12:44.670 --> 12:46.080
and restore justice to the people.

12:47.030 --> 12:49.030
You and your accomplices must die.

12:50.030 --> 12:50.510
Second,

12:51.984 --> 12:54.750
you'll confess where you've stashed
all the wealth you've squeezed out

12:55.568 --> 12:57.696
and put an end to your
treasonous ambitions.

12:58.790 --> 12:59.510
Third,

13:01.270 --> 13:03.150
Steward Zhao of Palace Food Bureau.

13:04.000 --> 13:05.080
Her only son

13:05.960 --> 13:07.150
was also listed

13:07.424 --> 13:09.728
in the Rouge Ledger
and acted under your coercion.

13:11.550 --> 13:13.360
So you've been

13:13.510 --> 13:16.790
investigating the poisoning
all these years.

13:18.200 --> 13:20.120
You've hidden your strength for so long

13:20.550 --> 13:22.360
and cast such a wide net.

13:22.750 --> 13:23.720
But that person

13:24.480 --> 13:25.910
wasn't me.

13:28.480 --> 13:29.910
Even now,

13:30.030 --> 13:31.150
you're still lying?

13:35.150 --> 13:37.510
You've hidden
your true abilities so well,

13:37.790 --> 13:39.840
and I'm truly impressed.

13:40.720 --> 13:42.510
Surely you've realized

13:43.080 --> 13:44.000
that whoever

13:44.870 --> 13:47.670
fed you those fermented cherries

13:48.720 --> 13:50.790
was the one who poisoned you.

13:51.030 --> 13:51.790
It's

13:52.200 --> 13:54.240
really that simple.

13:55.360 --> 13:57.510
With just one simple sentence,

14:00.360 --> 14:02.670
you're trying to drive a wedge
between Father and me.

14:06.510 --> 14:07.750
Then...

14:08.000 --> 14:09.670
I wish you

14:09.670 --> 14:11.550
the best of luck
in finding the real culprit.

14:12.000 --> 14:13.270
When you do,

14:14.240 --> 14:16.080
you'll know every word I said was true.

14:18.860 --> 14:21.020
(Court of Imperial Clan Affairs)

14:23.510 --> 14:24.030
Your Highness.

14:30.270 --> 14:30.880
Your Highness,

14:31.120 --> 14:32.480
did Prince Kang refuse to admit

14:32.480 --> 14:33.870
he was the one who poisoned you?

14:43.510 --> 14:44.670
I'm afraid

14:45.670 --> 14:46.720
he isn't the real culprit.

14:47.600 --> 14:49.120
Then did you get any new leads?

14:59.150 --> 14:59.960
Father.

15:01.750 --> 15:02.910
Have you forgotten?

15:03.480 --> 15:05.200
I told you

15:05.440 --> 15:06.840
that when we're alone,

15:07.480 --> 15:08.960
you should call me Dad.

15:09.360 --> 15:11.910
But my brothers all call you Father.

15:17.270 --> 15:20.150
"Father" and "son"

15:20.600 --> 15:21.870
belong to ruler and subject.

15:22.790 --> 15:24.320
But you and I...

15:25.080 --> 15:25.790
Fun, right?

15:26.000 --> 15:27.360
Are father and son.

15:29.120 --> 15:29.960
Yes!

15:34.840 --> 15:35.600
(Dad,)

15:35.952 --> 15:37.960
(you couldn't have been
the one who poisoned me.)

15:38.750 --> 15:39.910
(I don't believe that.)

15:40.840 --> 15:41.390
Your Highness,

15:41.790 --> 15:43.000
your poison is acting up again.

15:44.600 --> 15:45.750
Get me Xie Yunhuai.

15:47.660 --> 15:52.020
(Quiet View in the Pine Breeze)

16:01.120 --> 16:01.870
Physician Xie.

16:02.390 --> 16:04.360
Is there anything else we
can do to ease his pain?

16:05.100 --> 16:07.500
(Xie Yunhuai, Eldest Son of Duke of Xie)

16:07.568 --> 16:09.440
If nothing else works,
use acupuncture already.

16:09.720 --> 16:11.270
His Highness's pulse is still erratic,

16:11.600 --> 16:13.000
but it's gradually calming down.

16:13.390 --> 16:14.440
If I use acupuncture now,

16:14.750 --> 16:16.030
all our efforts will be wasted.

16:23.000 --> 16:23.630
No need.

16:26.080 --> 16:26.870
I can hold on.

16:39.808 --> 16:41.910
Physician Xie. There's a young lady
here to see you.

16:41.910 --> 16:43.490
She has something
important to discuss.

16:43.504 --> 16:44.736
Tell her to wait a moment.

16:45.000 --> 16:45.440
Yes, sir.

16:49.380 --> 16:53.460
(Qishi Medical Hall)

17:01.320 --> 17:02.080
Mo Yu,

17:02.480 --> 17:03.870
are you sure

17:03.870 --> 17:06.070
this physician is truly skilled?

17:06.960 --> 17:10.200
Xie Yunhuai was once the eldest son of
Duke Xie, one of the eight noble houses.

17:10.200 --> 17:12.350
Then he suddenly
severed ties with Duke Xie.

17:12.400 --> 17:13.620
He's highly skilled in medicine

17:13.620 --> 17:14.944
(Mulberry leaves)
and travels around treating patients.

17:15.024 --> 17:17.040
For some reason,
he's settled here long-term.

17:18.440 --> 17:20.510
He was willing to give up his fine robes

17:20.640 --> 17:22.030
and leave wealth and status behind

17:22.110 --> 17:24.590
to treat people out
here in the countryside.

17:24.960 --> 17:26.960
That shows he's a man
of noble character.

17:27.440 --> 17:29.070
The capital is a dangerous place.

17:29.240 --> 17:31.030
We need a physician we can trust.

17:31.640 --> 17:32.350
Your Highness,

17:32.590 --> 17:34.270
the Immortal Vine is extremely rare.

17:34.480 --> 17:36.310
It'll surely help your
cold illness greatly.

17:37.000 --> 17:39.260
Young Lady, the patient inside is
in critical condition.

17:39.270 --> 17:40.480
His life is hanging by a thread.

17:40.480 --> 17:42.550
Physician Xie is doing
everything he can to save him.

17:42.560 --> 17:43.520
Please wait a moment.

17:46.110 --> 17:47.310
We'll come back another day.

18:22.460 --> 18:24.940
(Quiet View in the Pine Breeze)

18:34.000 --> 18:35.590
Your Highness, you're finally awake.

18:41.920 --> 18:43.310
Are you feeling better?

18:44.640 --> 18:45.640
Much better.

18:46.270 --> 18:47.720
You really scared me.

18:48.110 --> 18:50.510
Just now, your heartbeat
and breathing were both gone.

18:50.512 --> 18:52.384
You have no idea how dangerous it was.

19:01.590 --> 19:03.070
The Immortal Vine saved me...

19:07.456 --> 19:09.030
You were blessed with good fortune.

19:09.480 --> 19:11.030
A kind-hearted young lady

19:11.030 --> 19:12.208
gave us the medicine in time.

19:12.310 --> 19:13.550
That's what saved your life.

19:15.000 --> 19:17.400
She was willing to give
up such a rare treasure?

19:18.000 --> 19:19.160
The young lady said

19:19.510 --> 19:21.270
a righteous man once gave her

19:21.360 --> 19:22.816
the Immortal Vine to save her life.

19:23.110 --> 19:25.930
Today, seeing someone who was
on the brink of death,

19:26.000 --> 19:27.160
she couldn't just stand by.

19:27.248 --> 19:29.600
Or she'd be betraying
the kindness that saved her.

19:32.180 --> 19:34.020
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

19:34.030 --> 19:34.750
Your Highness,

19:35.400 --> 19:37.160
how much longer are
we going to wait here?

19:37.960 --> 19:39.030
A little longer.

19:40.070 --> 19:41.680
But you're still ill.

19:42.270 --> 19:43.270
Besides,

19:43.590 --> 19:44.310
it's so late.

19:44.960 --> 19:46.550
Her Highness won't come out now.

19:46.550 --> 19:47.790
I'm not waiting for her.

19:49.830 --> 19:51.030
There are just some things

19:51.600 --> 19:52.590
I need to think through.

19:52.816 --> 19:54.830
Can't you think them
through back at the palace?

19:54.992 --> 19:56.960
Why do you have to
do it outside her manor?

19:59.110 --> 19:59.510
I...

20:04.680 --> 20:05.830
I'm just curious.

20:07.160 --> 20:09.160
There isn't even a streetlamp
on this road.

20:09.880 --> 20:10.960
It's so dark.

20:10.960 --> 20:13.080
Duke of Wei is stationed
at the border all year round.

20:13.280 --> 20:15.240
His Majesty once granted
him a grand residence,

20:15.600 --> 20:16.920
but he said he had no use for it.

20:17.070 --> 20:19.240
He didn't want to waste
manpower, money, or time.

20:19.920 --> 20:20.880
So he chose this place

20:21.030 --> 20:22.270
as his private residence.

20:22.864 --> 20:24.830
Compared with other
senior ministers' homes,

20:25.552 --> 20:26.830
it is indeed much more remote.

20:31.350 --> 20:33.540
(Court of Imperial Clan Affairs)
Prince Kang has corrupted

20:33.550 --> 20:35.350
the court and disrupted
the rule of the state.

20:35.550 --> 20:37.920
He is hereby sentenced to
immediate execution by beheading.

20:37.920 --> 20:41.200
His sister, Lady Xiao,
aided him in his crimes.

20:41.310 --> 20:43.270
She is hereby granted
death by white silk.

20:43.440 --> 20:46.480
The rest of his family shall be
stripped of their status and property

20:46.550 --> 20:48.750
and exiled 1,500 km away.

20:58.096 --> 20:59.550
(The Rouge case has been solved.)

20:59.880 --> 21:00.960
(Lady Xiao is dead.)

21:01.472 --> 21:02.880
(Corrupt, treacherous officials)

21:02.944 --> 21:04.176
(are a cancer to the state.)

21:04.200 --> 21:05.392
(They got what they deserved.)

21:06.060 --> 21:08.170
(The Shen family's great
grievance has been avenged.)

21:08.200 --> 21:09.616
(I came specially to comfort.)

21:17.540 --> 21:18.660
(Duke of Wei's Manor)

21:18.660 --> 21:20.480
His Majesty has issued a verbal decree.

21:23.030 --> 21:25.070
His Majesty requests
Commandery Princess Zhaoning

21:25.070 --> 21:26.288
to go to the hunting grounds

21:26.350 --> 21:30.110
outside the capital to observe
the martial display tomorrow.

21:30.160 --> 21:31.664
I shall obey His Majesty's decree.

21:31.728 --> 21:33.820
(Royal Hunting Grounds)

21:44.960 --> 21:46.720
Good!

21:53.160 --> 21:55.440
His Majesty has arrived!

22:07.070 --> 22:10.240
- Long live Father!
- Long live Father!

22:10.590 --> 22:11.400
Rise.

22:11.664 --> 22:13.408
- Thank you, Father.
- Thank you, Father.

22:20.310 --> 22:21.350
Huayong,

22:21.480 --> 22:23.184
it's windy at the hunting grounds today.

22:23.240 --> 22:25.270
You're dressed a little too lightly.

22:37.860 --> 22:39.840
(Duke of Ying,
Noble Consort Rong's elder brother)

22:45.590 --> 22:46.480
Thank you, Father.

22:52.720 --> 22:53.590
Changqing,

22:54.480 --> 22:55.790
you don't look well.

22:56.500 --> 22:57.800
The weather has been cold lately,

22:57.810 --> 23:00.640
and you've visited Fahua Temple to
chant scriptures and pray for blessings.

23:00.656 --> 23:02.080
You must take good care of yourself.

23:02.416 --> 23:04.016
Thank you for your concern, Uncle.

23:10.920 --> 23:11.790
Xihe.

23:22.720 --> 23:24.070
In previous martial displays,

23:24.270 --> 23:27.310
I've always allowed everyone to
compose poems for the occasion.

23:27.680 --> 23:28.440
Today,

23:28.600 --> 23:31.310
since Commandery Princess Zhaoning
is attending for the first time,

23:31.310 --> 23:32.510
the theme

23:32.680 --> 23:35.720
shall be decided by her.

23:36.780 --> 23:37.790
Thank you, Your Majesty.

23:38.240 --> 23:39.400
Princes,

23:40.000 --> 23:42.000
if any of you admire
Commandery Princess Zhaoning,

23:42.440 --> 23:43.110
today is

23:43.400 --> 23:45.920
the perfect chance
to declare your feelings.

23:48.350 --> 23:49.640
In my humble opinion,

23:49.696 --> 23:52.384
the land is splendid, and all
flowers bloom in their own beauty.

23:52.448 --> 23:54.208
Different flowers
appeal to different eyes.

23:54.270 --> 23:55.590
Why don't we ask everyone

23:55.590 --> 23:57.184
to compose on the theme of flowers?

23:57.264 --> 23:59.040
Each may choose the bloom they favor.

23:59.350 --> 24:01.030
What do you think, Your Majesty?

24:02.310 --> 24:03.200
Good.

24:03.880 --> 24:05.400
Very good.

24:05.720 --> 24:07.200
Who will compose the first poem?

24:13.960 --> 24:14.640
Father.

24:17.310 --> 24:19.510
Greetings, Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

24:20.720 --> 24:22.030
Greetings, Prince Ning.

24:23.640 --> 24:25.400
At the banquet in Taiji Hall last time,

24:25.400 --> 24:27.000
I should've been there to welcome you.

24:27.350 --> 24:28.400
Unfortunately,

24:28.400 --> 24:30.110
I was tied up with official duties

24:30.110 --> 24:31.640
and couldn't arrive in time.

24:31.888 --> 24:33.328
Please don't hold it against me.

24:34.110 --> 24:35.350
Your Highness, you're too kind.

24:36.550 --> 24:38.310
Then I'll start things off

24:38.880 --> 24:39.960
with a poem

24:39.960 --> 24:41.070
to express my apology.

24:42.720 --> 24:44.480
When wild geese fly south
from the frontier,

24:45.160 --> 24:47.400
white jasmine shines upon iron armor.

24:48.070 --> 24:50.440
I'd gladly build
a golden chamber for it,

24:52.000 --> 24:54.920
and make every border gate its home.

24:58.070 --> 24:59.310
Prince Ning,

24:59.310 --> 25:01.640
you compared a lady to jasmine
from the Western Regions.

25:01.680 --> 25:03.110
By placing her in a golden chamber,

25:03.110 --> 25:05.790
you ease the jasmine's
longing for its homeland.

25:06.200 --> 25:07.880
In the eyes of all ladies,

25:08.440 --> 25:10.030
that is the highest form of devotion.

25:14.110 --> 25:16.350
You have such refined leisure,

25:16.440 --> 25:17.880
and such outstanding grace.

25:30.880 --> 25:31.480
Father.

25:33.296 --> 25:35.400
Commandery Princess Zhaoning
saved my life.

25:35.400 --> 25:36.510
I'll never forget that.

25:37.030 --> 25:38.160
Protecting the princes

25:38.550 --> 25:40.000
is every subject's duty.

25:40.310 --> 25:41.550
I'm no exception.

25:41.640 --> 25:43.510
You're strong-willed
and straightforward.

25:44.640 --> 25:45.680
In my eyes,

25:46.350 --> 25:49.000
only the blazing pomegranate flower

25:49.270 --> 25:50.960
can compare to you.

25:51.480 --> 25:53.920
I offer this poem to express my heart.

25:54.944 --> 25:56.720
Pomegranate flames
burn against frosted blades,

25:56.768 --> 25:58.592
and true regard is
carved deep into the bone.

25:58.680 --> 26:00.352
If I could repay Hongfu's noble spirit,

26:00.440 --> 26:03.160
I'd ride ten thousand miles
and scatter the northern dust.

26:05.960 --> 26:08.550
Prince Lie, you aspire to
win glory through battle.

26:08.550 --> 26:09.720
If I should win your favor,

26:10.030 --> 26:10.920
I swear to spend my life

26:11.750 --> 26:13.000
to give up all silks and finery

26:13.480 --> 26:15.590
and be yours alone for life.

26:25.200 --> 26:26.920
Prince Lie, your wholehearted devotion

26:27.750 --> 26:29.680
will be a priceless treasure

26:30.000 --> 26:31.590
to the future Princess Lie.

26:34.080 --> 26:35.270
Thank you, Your Highness.

26:42.550 --> 26:45.440
Prince Ning and Prince Lie

26:45.590 --> 26:47.270
have both made their feelings clear.

26:47.270 --> 26:48.070
And...

26:48.070 --> 26:48.720
I, too,

26:51.648 --> 26:53.344
wish to ask
for your hand in marriage.

27:18.200 --> 27:19.160
Huayong,

27:20.310 --> 27:23.160
you also wish to marry
Commandery Princess Zhaoning?

27:23.310 --> 27:24.200
Yes, Father.

27:26.510 --> 27:27.680
My health is poor.

27:28.688 --> 27:30.110
In scholarship and martial arts,

27:30.510 --> 27:31.550
poetry and hunting,

27:31.720 --> 27:32.750
I'm nothing remarkable.

27:33.200 --> 27:33.880
Today,

27:34.320 --> 27:35.550
I'll make a poor showing.

27:39.550 --> 27:42.400
All mouths praise the blooms in glory,

27:43.270 --> 27:46.160
while your house's steps
shine beneath your light.

27:47.960 --> 27:50.830
My heart wishes only
to be a dew-bearing blossom,

27:55.440 --> 27:59.240
flying only toward
where your heart turns.

28:03.400 --> 28:05.510
Your Highness, are you

28:06.400 --> 28:08.240
comparing yourself to a flower?

28:08.960 --> 28:09.830
Yes.

28:11.790 --> 28:13.550
Whatever flower Her Highness likes,

28:14.000 --> 28:16.310
that's the flower I'll be.

28:19.640 --> 28:21.680
Even the Crown Prince

28:22.000 --> 28:23.480
admires Her Highness.

28:24.000 --> 28:25.640
What right do the rest of us brothers

28:25.920 --> 28:27.880
have to ask for her hand?

28:32.400 --> 28:33.720
Changmin, that's not true.

28:34.310 --> 28:35.480
I'm willing to compete fairly

28:35.830 --> 28:37.110
with all my brothers.

28:39.440 --> 28:40.510
Xihe.

28:42.110 --> 28:44.030
What do you think?

28:45.750 --> 28:46.560
I'm grateful

28:46.640 --> 28:48.640
for the Crown Prince's
and the princes' affection.

28:49.590 --> 28:51.070
The man I wish to marry

28:51.510 --> 28:53.030
must be someone I love

28:53.160 --> 28:54.200
and grow old beside.

28:55.510 --> 28:56.736
I'm afraid I'll need more time

28:56.752 --> 28:58.750
before I can give an
answer, Your Majesty.

29:00.110 --> 29:01.160
Marriage

29:02.000 --> 29:03.750
is one of life's greatest matters.

29:04.070 --> 29:04.920
It can't be rushed,

29:05.350 --> 29:06.790
nor can it be taken lightly.

29:08.640 --> 29:09.880
Thank you, Your Majesty.

29:12.110 --> 29:14.750
A grand feast has been prepared today.

29:15.160 --> 29:17.350
Enjoy yourselves.

29:19.072 --> 29:21.008
- Thank you, Father.
- Thank you, Father.

29:28.400 --> 29:29.000
Uncle.

29:39.088 --> 29:41.920
I didn't expect Crown Prince to ask
for the Commandery Princess's hand too.

29:43.070 --> 29:44.070
Don't worry.

29:45.790 --> 29:47.110
The Princess said

29:47.584 --> 29:49.472
she wants someone she can grow old with.

29:49.750 --> 29:50.790
Based on that alone,

29:51.720 --> 29:53.030
the Crown Prince is already out.

29:57.110 --> 29:59.310
But what lady in the world

30:00.160 --> 30:01.640
wouldn't be tempted

30:01.960 --> 30:03.920
by the position of Crown Princess?

30:04.640 --> 30:05.680
So,

30:05.920 --> 30:07.110
the Crown Prince

30:07.680 --> 30:09.240
isn't without a chance.

30:14.030 --> 30:14.790
It's fine.

30:16.750 --> 30:17.790
I'll help you.

30:20.960 --> 30:21.790
Your Highness,

30:21.790 --> 30:24.110
the royal hunting grounds
really are extraordinary.

30:27.510 --> 30:28.480
What do you think

30:28.480 --> 30:30.310
the Crown Prince took today?
Some miracle tonic?

30:30.440 --> 30:31.510
He's gotten so carried away.

30:32.110 --> 30:33.590
She's the capital's most noble lady,

30:33.590 --> 30:35.640
with so many princes
fighting for her hand.

30:36.480 --> 30:38.680
Of course the Crown Prince
doesn't want to be left behind.

30:38.690 --> 30:40.390
But she's a fierce lady
from the northwest.

30:40.400 --> 30:41.600
How could she possibly stand

30:41.616 --> 30:43.680
spending her life serving
medicine in the East Palace?

30:44.640 --> 30:46.200
Everyone knows he won't live long.

30:46.350 --> 30:47.750
Now even his face has gone pale.

30:47.750 --> 30:49.350
What a complete joke.

30:50.200 --> 30:51.110
How dare you!

30:53.160 --> 30:54.900
Who are you to gossip
about the Crown Prince?

30:54.910 --> 30:56.980
- Please forgive us, Prince Ning.
- Please forgive us.

30:56.992 --> 30:58.016
If this happens again,

30:58.110 --> 31:00.270
the Censorate will
summon you for questioning.

31:01.696 --> 31:03.270
What are you standing around for?

31:03.590 --> 31:04.160
Go.

31:14.110 --> 31:15.480
Greetings, Prince Ning.

31:15.680 --> 31:16.720
What a coincidence.

31:17.110 --> 31:19.750
I was just about to look for you.

31:19.750 --> 31:21.030
May I ask

31:21.030 --> 31:21.960
what you need me for?

31:22.240 --> 31:24.110
I heard you enjoy blending incenses.

31:24.240 --> 31:26.880
My mother was born
into a family of incense.

31:27.920 --> 31:30.590
This Incense Record
is the finest of its kind.

31:31.270 --> 31:33.880
All incense lovers
have long sought after it.

31:34.960 --> 31:36.590
After my mother passed away,

31:36.590 --> 31:37.880
she left it to me.

31:38.350 --> 31:40.350
I hope you'll accept it.

31:41.510 --> 31:43.030
Your Highness, there's no need.

31:43.168 --> 31:45.000
Since it's a keepsake
from your late mother,

31:45.160 --> 31:46.720
I absolutely can't accept it.

31:48.590 --> 31:49.960
If this book

31:50.096 --> 31:52.550
can be given to someone who
truly understands incense,

31:52.750 --> 31:55.920
then my mother's lifelong
work won't go to waste.

31:59.200 --> 32:01.830
Your Highness, please don't refuse it.

32:11.830 --> 32:13.510
Thank you, Prince Ning.

32:18.720 --> 32:19.480
Your Highness,

32:20.110 --> 32:21.920
I'll take my leave.

32:27.920 --> 32:29.310
I didn't expect Prince Ning

32:29.310 --> 32:31.200
to prepare gifts for me and Mo Yu too.

32:31.830 --> 32:32.550
Your Highness,

32:32.550 --> 32:35.480
Prince Ning is devoted to the law
and conducts himself with integrity.

32:35.640 --> 32:37.350
Everyone in the capital praises him.

32:37.920 --> 32:39.790
Someone as perfect as him,

32:40.000 --> 32:42.200
would you consider choosing
him as your husband?

32:43.160 --> 32:44.160
People aren't gods.

32:45.200 --> 32:46.720
How could anyone be without flaws?

32:49.640 --> 32:50.200
Your Highness,

32:50.480 --> 32:51.680
if Prince Ning hadn't forced

32:52.000 --> 32:53.070
the gifts on Her Highness,

32:53.120 --> 32:54.960
she wouldn't have accepted a single one.

32:55.510 --> 32:56.270
Tian Yuan.

32:58.270 --> 32:59.510
I remember Changmin

32:59.824 --> 33:01.480
is skilled in painting and calligraphy.

33:02.510 --> 33:04.350
Prince Ning is indeed quite accomplished

33:04.590 --> 33:05.640
in that regard.

33:06.440 --> 33:07.440
Anyone close to him

33:07.616 --> 33:09.776
receives his paintings
or calligraphy as gifts.

33:12.960 --> 33:15.070
Changmin has always
seemed noble and upright,

33:16.680 --> 33:17.960
with a sterling reputation.

33:18.590 --> 33:20.960
I wonder if he truly lives up to it.

33:27.310 --> 33:28.240
This way!

33:30.200 --> 33:30.750
Your Highness.

33:33.070 --> 33:34.030
You're here.

33:34.960 --> 33:36.310
Greetings, Your Highness.

33:36.992 --> 33:38.160
Please have a seat.

33:51.584 --> 33:53.296
What are you watching, Your Highness?

33:54.920 --> 33:56.160
I can't take part

33:56.240 --> 33:57.550
in these contests myself,

33:57.552 --> 33:59.264
- but watching from the side...
- Keep up.

33:59.264 --> 34:00.270
Has its own charm, too.

34:02.590 --> 34:03.200
Tian Yuan.

34:10.880 --> 34:11.480
Your Highness.

34:11.632 --> 34:13.232
His Highness specially instructed us

34:13.510 --> 34:15.520
to prepare steamed crab
and pheasant soup for you.

34:16.840 --> 34:17.840
Thank you, Your Highness.

34:18.550 --> 34:20.630
The weather is still
a little chilly today.

34:20.720 --> 34:22.384
Why don't you eat while you watch?

34:22.800 --> 34:23.400
All right?

34:25.920 --> 34:27.710
Your Highness, don't catch a chill.

34:38.110 --> 34:39.550
Just now, you said

34:39.760 --> 34:40.840
you had feelings for me.

34:42.480 --> 34:44.070
Ever since I came to the capital,

34:44.070 --> 34:45.480
in many people's eyes,

34:46.360 --> 34:47.800
I've hardly been a good person.

34:51.840 --> 34:54.000
You have a gentle and kind side, too.

34:55.960 --> 34:57.480
It's just that to others,

34:58.440 --> 34:59.480
it isn't very obvious.

35:00.320 --> 35:01.400
To me,

35:02.110 --> 35:03.030
Your Highness,

35:04.000 --> 35:06.070
you truly aren't the best
choice for a husband.

35:11.710 --> 35:13.190
I remember the first time

35:13.440 --> 35:15.480
you asked Father to
choose a husband for you,

35:16.230 --> 35:17.630
you asked for mutual affection.

35:19.280 --> 35:21.280
Today, you also spoke
of growing old together.

35:21.590 --> 35:22.960
With this frail body of mine,

35:23.220 --> 35:24.590
I'm certainly not the best choice.

35:25.550 --> 35:26.920
But as long as you believe

35:28.030 --> 35:29.800
I'm someone who would never hurt you,

35:30.550 --> 35:31.190
that's enough.

35:52.580 --> 35:55.020
(Bu Shulin, Heir to
the Marquis of Shunan)

35:55.030 --> 35:56.790
I'm Bu Shulin,
heir to the Marquis of Shunan.

35:57.800 --> 35:58.920
Greetings, Your Highness.

36:01.760 --> 36:03.070
As a member of the Imperial Guard,

36:03.070 --> 36:04.790
I'm responsible
for protecting the capital.

36:07.376 --> 36:09.070
After Prince Kang's second son,
Xiao Jing,

36:09.150 --> 36:11.110
instigated Second Young Master Li
to harm you,

36:11.110 --> 36:12.110
he fled the capital.

36:12.230 --> 36:13.960
I caught that rotten bastard

36:13.960 --> 36:15.070
to give you an explanation,

36:15.070 --> 36:16.784
and then sent him
into exile in Dongling.

36:16.976 --> 36:19.510
Also, the runaway slave you
issued a warrant for,

36:21.200 --> 36:22.848
Lady Xiao already had her silenced.

36:25.670 --> 36:26.510
Xihe,

36:26.800 --> 36:27.800
are you pleased

36:27.872 --> 36:28.832
with these two gifts?

36:31.520 --> 36:32.320
They're all right.

36:36.144 --> 36:37.440
You still won't accept your fate?

36:41.150 --> 36:42.480
Who told you to throw up here?

36:45.360 --> 36:46.070
Clean it up.

36:48.960 --> 36:49.710
Xihe,

36:49.808 --> 36:51.110
if you're still not satisfied,

36:51.110 --> 36:51.920
go ahead and hit him.

36:51.920 --> 36:53.030
Just don't kill him.

37:15.664 --> 37:17.360
Thank you for your trouble.

37:17.630 --> 37:19.360
Have some plum drink and take a rest.

37:19.760 --> 37:20.920
Doing things for you

37:21.424 --> 37:22.592
is no trouble at all.

37:24.880 --> 37:26.550
Since you've gone to such trouble,

37:26.880 --> 37:27.920
as thanks,

37:28.360 --> 37:29.760
I'll give you a warning, too.

37:29.920 --> 37:30.800
A warning about what?

37:31.030 --> 37:32.710
The Marquis of Shunan's only child,

37:32.960 --> 37:34.880
Bu Shulin, heir to the marquisate,

37:35.360 --> 37:36.440
is actually a lady.

37:39.230 --> 37:40.030
Your Highness,

37:40.280 --> 37:41.840
you can't just say things like that.

37:41.960 --> 37:43.150
The scent you're wearing

37:44.150 --> 37:45.760
is Spring Snow, a lady's incense.

37:46.150 --> 37:48.510
It's blended mainly
with spring snow flowers,

37:48.710 --> 37:50.000
delicate and lightly sweet,

37:50.000 --> 37:51.230
made especially for ladies.

37:51.550 --> 37:52.760
No man would wear it.

37:53.360 --> 37:54.880
Though you used very little,

37:55.150 --> 37:56.280
so others can't smell it,

37:56.280 --> 37:57.110
I can.

38:07.550 --> 38:10.070
My father has always held
Marquis Bu in high regard.

38:10.440 --> 38:11.960
So you can rest assured.

38:12.710 --> 38:14.840
My family and your family

38:15.280 --> 38:16.360
have never been enemies.

38:17.000 --> 38:18.110
But if you hurt me...

38:20.624 --> 38:21.920
There's poison in this tea.

38:23.590 --> 38:24.960
Please don't joke around.

38:36.440 --> 38:37.070
The antidote.

38:48.920 --> 38:49.760
The cup was poisoned.

38:56.360 --> 38:57.230
Still the antidote.

39:00.030 --> 39:00.800
Your Highness,

39:01.616 --> 39:02.760
when you act like this,

39:02.760 --> 39:04.670
my poor little heart can barely take it.

39:25.760 --> 39:27.230
Right about now,

39:28.030 --> 39:29.510
your limbs should be going weak.

39:49.150 --> 39:50.760
So it was a trap within a trap.

39:52.880 --> 39:54.400
I won't expose your identity.

39:55.230 --> 39:56.710
But if you try to harm me,

39:57.550 --> 39:59.030
that'll be a different matter.

40:04.150 --> 40:06.000
I acted on impulse just now.

40:07.230 --> 40:08.520
I didn't really mean to hurt you.

40:09.590 --> 40:10.710
I believe you.

40:11.630 --> 40:13.000
You brought Xiao Jing here today

40:13.280 --> 40:14.230
to win me over

40:14.710 --> 40:16.440
because we're both far from home,

40:16.880 --> 40:18.230
and you want an ally.

40:18.960 --> 40:20.280
Here in the capital,

40:21.630 --> 40:23.280
you and I are in similar positions.

40:23.630 --> 40:25.070
The other princes and noble ladies

40:25.820 --> 40:27.670
all keep their true intentions
hidden from us.

40:28.710 --> 40:30.630
If you're willing,

40:31.550 --> 40:33.360
I'll treat you like my own sister.

40:38.280 --> 40:38.880
The antidote.

40:49.760 --> 40:52.280
I'm the kind of person
who doesn't care about personal ties.

40:52.300 --> 40:53.344
I only look at interests.

40:53.376 --> 40:55.840
If either of us needs something
from the other in the future,

40:56.096 --> 40:57.510
we'll need to offer something real.

40:58.630 --> 41:00.630
You're clever enough to be frightening,

41:01.168 --> 41:02.590
but you're refreshingly honest.

41:03.710 --> 41:04.960
How interesting.

41:05.360 --> 41:06.630
I'm keeping your secret for you.

41:07.030 --> 41:09.110
That means you owe me a huge favor.

41:09.550 --> 41:10.360
Don't worry.

41:11.280 --> 41:12.150
One day,

41:13.150 --> 41:14.190
I'll repay you.

41:31.280 --> 41:33.280
That man is clearly the real Hua Fuhai.

41:33.280 --> 41:35.104
And the handsome man beside him

41:35.168 --> 41:37.610
is Cui Jinbai, Vice Minister
of the Court of Judicial Review.

41:37.630 --> 41:39.230
They both answer to him.

41:40.320 --> 41:41.190
Wait for me here.

41:41.440 --> 41:42.360
I'll be right back.

41:44.760 --> 41:45.670
Maybe

41:46.230 --> 41:47.630
he's the Tagara Incense.

41:47.630 --> 41:51.780
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

41:53.791 --> 41:56.731
♪I've hidden so many words♪

41:57.351 --> 42:00.151
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

42:01.021 --> 42:07.991
♪So never uncover♪

42:08.181 --> 42:10.541
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

42:11.671 --> 42:14.401
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

42:15.361 --> 42:20.701
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

42:22.461 --> 42:25.281
♪Every answer I gave♪

42:26.081 --> 42:28.931
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

42:29.721 --> 42:33.091
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

42:33.351 --> 42:36.661
♪How hard it truly was?♪

42:39.631 --> 42:43.071
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

42:44.061 --> 42:46.391
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

42:47.661 --> 42:53.421
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

42:54.831 --> 42:57.961
♪It's a shame I never could♪

42:58.411 --> 43:01.421
♪Give you a moon in return♪

43:01.531 --> 43:08.171
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

43:08.171 --> 43:11.841
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

43:12.711 --> 43:15.471
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

43:15.911 --> 43:19.041
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

43:19.481 --> 43:25.431
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

43:26.831 --> 43:30.381
♪You'll never♪

43:30.661 --> 43:40.131
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪
